@startuml
title Logout Sequence (/api/auth/logout)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor User
boundary "ProfileScreen UI" as ProfileScreen
entity "RefreshTokenRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as RefreshTokenRequest
control "AuthController" as AuthController
control "AuthService" as AuthService
entity "RefreshToken" as RefreshTokenEntity
control "RefreshTokenRepository" as RefreshTokenRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
collections "LocalStorage" as LocalStorage
note over ProfileScreen, MySQL
RefreshTokenRequest exists in API Contracts and is reused by logout.
SecureStorage and Google sign-out are handled in mobile code, but are not drawn as lifelines here.
end note
User -> ProfileScreen: Click Logout button
ProfileScreen -> ProfileScreen: Get refresh token
alt Refresh token exists
ProfileScreen -> RefreshTokenRequest: Create request data(refresh_token)
ProfileScreen -> AuthController: POST /api/auth/logoutRefreshTokenRequest
AuthController -> AuthController: Validate RefreshTokenRequest
alt Request validation fails
AuthController --> ProfileScreen: HTTP 400 error
else Request validation success
AuthController -> AuthService: LogoutAsync(refresh token)
AuthService -> AuthService: Hash refresh token
AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository: StageRevokeAsync(tokenHash)
RefreshTokenRepository -> DbContext: Find token by hash
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT refresh_tokens
MySQL --> DbContext: Token row or null
DbContext -> RefreshTokenEntity: Materialize RefreshToken?
RefreshTokenEntity --> DbContext: RefreshToken or null
DbContext --> RefreshTokenRepository: Result
alt Refresh token invalid
RefreshTokenRepository --> AuthService: false
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized result
AuthController --> ProfileScreen: HTTP 401 Invalid refresh token
else Refresh token valid
RefreshTokenRepository -> RefreshTokenEntity: Set RevokedAt
RefreshTokenEntity --> RefreshTokenRepository: RefreshToken updated
RefreshTokenRepository -> DbContext: Track RefreshToken
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE refresh_tokens
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> RefreshTokenRepository: Save result
RefreshTokenRepository --> AuthService: true
AuthService --> AuthController: Success result
AuthController --> ProfileScreen: HTTP 200 OK
end
end
else No refresh token
ProfileScreen -> ProfileScreen: Skip API logout request
end
note over ProfileScreen, LocalStorage
Current mobile behavior: local logout still continues even when API logout fails.
end note
ProfileScreen -> ProfileScreen: Sign out Google account
ProfileScreen -> ProfileScreen: Clear access and refresh tokens
ProfileScreen -> LocalStorage: Clear local app data
LocalStorage --> ProfileScreen: Cleared
ProfileScreen --> User: Navigate to LoginScreen
@enduml
